# inengine/calendar

- PHP `^8.5`; Pint + Pest + PHPStan like other InEngine packages.
- This package owns **domain contracts and DTOs** (providers, events, calendar selection, query/cache). Do **not** put Google API clients here.
- Host app (LTC #143) and adapters consume this package; Google lives in **`inengine/calendar-google-adapter`** (often called the **Calendar adapter** — repo/folder **`Calender-Google-Adapter`**).
- Read **`.cursor/SESSION_HANDOFF.md`** at the start of substantive work (includes the two-package idea sketch).
